            "title": "Foreword"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "_852276fe-5b39-c964-b373-b5f0b0182e48",
                "semx_id": "_852276fe-5b39-c964-b373-b5f0b0182e48"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "This publication has been prepared by the Maintenance Group of the OIML Certification System (OIML-CS) Management Committee."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "_8f58c4f1-6ad1-fc2d-ab23-7f08776fd721",
                "semx_id": "_8f58c4f1-6ad1-fc2d-ab23-7f08776fd721"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The Management Committee approved this Edition 3 of OIML-CS OD-02 at its Ninth meeting on 06 March 2024 and it was published on 11 March 2024. This edition takes effect immediately upon publication."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "_1703809d-0e27-7ca5-4f7a-2b53f8cde45b",
                "semx_id": "_1703809d-0e27-7ca5-4f7a-2b53f8cde45b"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "This publication is directly related to the Framework for the OIML Certification System (OIML-CS) (OIML B 18 "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "OIML B 18:2022",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "eref",
                      "attrs": {
                        "target": "OIML_B_18",
                        "citeas": "OIML B 18:2022"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ") which contains the framework for the operation of the OIML-CS."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "_7c560494-58df-ea69-a0f1-ad65cb879ea1",
